WEBVTT

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:05.960
On the last episode of Dragon Ball Z, the war between men and machines soared to new heights

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:12.200
as Goku battled Android 19, a radically advanced artificial life form designed by Dr. Jaro

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:18.690
to be the ultimate fighting machine. After controlling the entire fight, Goku made a tactical

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:23.290
error by inadvertently recharging the android's energy level and soon found himself on the wrong

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:29.910
end of several punishing blows. Usually, when the going gets tough, Goku gets going, but this time

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.440
The iron-willed Saiyan was unable to respond.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:36.080
Most unexpectedly, Goku became paralyzed with pain

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:38.340
and seemed unable to continue the fight.

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:42.750
Trunks' projection that Goku would contract a terrible disease

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.150
has now come true.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.780
But it couldn't have come at a worse time.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.680
I've never seen Goku this hurt before.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:29.980
This is ho-

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:53.260
Donasek! Hey, Trunks, what happens to me? Will the androids destroy me as well?

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:59.440
Not long from now, you're going to contract a new virus that infects the heart. It will finish you.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:02:59.900
What?

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:06.770
It's a radical virus. It will begin spreading soon. Not even a Super Saiyan can beat it.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:12.960
What a bummer. Losing it all to a strange virus? So what can I do?

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.720
Here you are. Take this, pal. It's for your health.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:18.710
My health?

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.300
It's an antidote.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:25.480
Here, in your time, there's no cure for that nasty virus you're gonna get.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.180
But in mine there is. Take this as soon as you get sick and you will be fine.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:37.060
You have to wait, Gohan. Your dad's still in command, and we can't interfere until he says so.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:41.760
But there is one thing we can do. We've got to give him a senzu bean.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.240
Terrible. I feel like I'm dying.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.010
Raoku! Senzu Bean! Catch!

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:12.150
I owe you one, Krillin. Thank goodness for Corrin.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:17.020
We are all too familiar with the restorative powers of the Senzu Bean.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:22.600
Yes. The Bean's magic has begun to heal your body just as it healed your friends.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.080
Only we will not allow you the time to recover.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.450
