00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:54.280
Oh, well, if I'm unable to blast you away, I'll just have to pound you into a pulp, that's all.

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:58.620
You know some of my moves, but I know every one of yours, Vegeta.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.390
Dr. Jaro studied you very thoroughly.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:09.870
Oh, is that a fact? Then why were you so surprised when Kakarot changed into a Super Saiyan?

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:15.300
I'll tell you why. Because your database doesn't cover the battles we had in space.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:20.620
Your careless creator excluded the most important chapter that you need in your memory banks.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:21.360
Oh?

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:28.370
Quite right, my friend. Now tell me, does a machine like you ever experience fear?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:29.400
Well, for sale, I'm confused.

