00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.520
No! No more! That's it. I don't care!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:40.150
I didn't care anymore. I didn't care about being better than Kakarot.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:43.020
I didn't care about being a Super Saiyan.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:45.840
I didn't even care if I lived or not.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:48.080
I didn't care about anything.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:55.980
That's right. So that's the way I transformed.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.390
That's how I became a Super Saiyan.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.870
The Royal Prince has awakened.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:09.290
I am the greatest of all Saiyans once again.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.210
Enough of your nonsense, fool.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:18.100
You may be a Super Saiyan, but even your powers are no match for our awesome strength.

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:20.400
